The **Beat Cop** is the neighborhood's friendly face: young, new to
the force, and always glad to give directions or lend a hand. On quiet
shifts he jots down notes for the crime novel he's writing, as long as
his boss doesn't catch him at it. *Attack (Pistol) +2, Combat Expert
+1, Knowledge (The City In and Out) +2, Knowledge (Writing) +1,
Perceptive +1, Position of Power (Police Officer) +2; Secret (Writing
Aspirations) −1, Servitude (Police Department and the Common Good) −2,
Soft Spot (Dessert) −1.*

